{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heading out to help your astronaut buddy Scott do a routine ship check, traps you in an endless loop. Observe your surroundings carefully to reach the airlock in the sector number 7 to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/extras/5e6fd78a1187705eb92d89ff460ebf2c.poster.avif?t=1756926193\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/extras/5e6fd78a1187705eb92d89ff460ebf2c.webm?t=1756926193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/extras/5e6fd78a1187705eb92d89ff460ebf2c.mp4?t=1756926193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't overlook any anomalies. If you find anomalies, turn back immediately. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you don't find anomalies, continue forward. To escape the station.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Apollogies takes between 30 and 90 minutes to complete.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention when entering a new sector. Has something changed in, or outside, the ship? Go back. Everything seems in place, nothing out of the order, no weird noises or things missing? Go forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/extras/544d1a0195d7336abef14763f83a9857.poster.avif?t=1756926193\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/extras/544d1a0195d7336abef14763f83a9857.webm?t=1756926193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/extras/544d1a0195d7336abef14763f83a9857.mp4?t=1756926193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 unique anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies generated procedurally\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astronaut buddy is...sometimes..larger than usual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there are weird ship noises to\u00a0be cautious of</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also - if your astronaut buddy is limping... don't fall for it\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has gone wrong aboard the research facility. Scott tried to guide you through the communication system, but his instructions didn't match reality. Missing equipment, shifted objects, and strange sounds plague your journey through identical corridors that somehow lead nowhere.    <br><br>And your buddy Scott? Well, all he can now do to help you is to Apollo-gies for bringing you here\u00a0in the first place.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940320?t=1756926193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940320?t=1756926193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/f181ca5362ebed5a99d4eafbf6c3623c69301c3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756926193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/f181ca5362ebed5a99d4eafbf6c3623c69301c3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756926193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_pa