vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/extras/544d1a0195d7336abef14763f83a9857.mp4?t=1756926193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 unique anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies generated procedurally\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astronaut buddy is...sometimes..larger than usual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there are weird ship noises to\u00a0be cautious of</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also - if your astronaut buddy is limping... don't fall for it\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has gone wrong aboard the research facility. Scott tried to guide you through the communication system, but his instructions didn't match reality. Missing equipment, shifted objects, and strange sounds plague your journey through identical corridors that somehow lead nowhere.    <br><br>And your buddy Scott? Well, all he can now do to help you is to Apollo-gies for bringing you here\u00a0in the first place.</p>","developers":["Spatium Interactive d.o.o"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940320/61125756093ccac347eab9cbd86dd1f08282df86/header.jpg?t=1756926193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257179910,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179910/movie480.mp4?t=1755239973","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179910/movie_max.mp4?t=1755239973"},"name":"My Apollogies - Official Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179910/ef06dd56a3c4e8b4170a67d3ab585b5654bb30f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755239